$\mathrm{C}_{2} \mathrm{H}_{2}$ forms copper acetylide with ammonical $\mathrm{Cu}_{2} \mathrm{Cl}_{2}$

$\begin{array}{l}

\mathrm{Cu}_{2} \mathrm{Cl}_{2}+2 \mathrm{NH}_{4} \mathrm{OH} \rightarrow \mathrm{Cu}_{2} \mathrm{O}+\mathrm{H}_{2} \mathrm{O}+2 \mathrm{NH}_{4} \mathrm{Cl} \\

\mathrm{Cu}_{2} \mathrm{O}+\mathrm{C}_{2} \mathrm{H}_{2} \rightarrow \underset{\text { (copper acetylide) }}{\mathrm{Cu}_{2} \mathrm{C}_{2}}+\mathrm{H}_{2} \mathrm{O}

\end{array}$
